&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in our Chippendale head office in Sydney and reporting to our Director of IT, you will lead the evolution of our APAC IT team from a traditional service desk into a high-performing, globally integrated IT operations hub. Covering HelloConnect Philippines (1,600+ staff across three sites), YouFoodz, BeCool Logistics, and HelloFresh ANZ, this is one of the most dynamic and operationally complex IT leadership roles in the HelloFresh Group.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this position, you will connect regional teams with global leadership, turning big-picture strategy into clear local results, preventing operational silos, and building an IT function ready to scale. As Associate Director, you will act as a trusted advisor to senior executives, shape global IT strategy, and champion IT Operations best practices across the APAC region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You will…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Define &amp;amp; Own Regional Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Shape and execute the APAC IT strategy across all entities, balancing speed, scope, and quality to seamlessly integrate the region into the global HelloFresh ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Master Asynchronous Work:&lt;/strong&gt; Guide a distributed team across Australia, New Zealand, and the Philippines while syncing with Berlin and Toronto. You write clear direction and document key decisions, empowering time-zone-agnostic execution where real-time overlap is optimized and asynchronous is the default.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Evolve Regional Operations:&lt;/strong&gt; Transform a service-desk model into a specialized IT Operations framework, building deep domain expertise so local teams can operate autonomously without constant escalation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner with Executive Stakeholders:&lt;/strong&gt; Serve as the trusted IT advisor to APAC business leadership, translating complex technical trade-offs into clear, high-level business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive SLAs, Compliance &amp;amp; Audits:&lt;/strong&gt; Govern regional performance using Jira Service Management insights, maintaining a robust audit posture and keeping global IT leadership informed on key metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion AI Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead by example with AI tools, actively embedding AI-driven workflows across the team as a core operational standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize Finance &amp;amp; Influence Global Strategy:&lt;/strong&gt; Maximize regional ROI through smart vendor negotiations, tooling consolidation, and infrastructure streamlining, while representing APAC as a key contributor to global IT strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have/are…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Async-First Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to manage across major time-zone gaps (e.g., aligning Manila with different hemispheres) using clear written communication and structure over constant calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;APAC Senior Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience at the Associate Director level (or equivalent), with direct accountability for multi-country IT strategy, portfolio ownership, and service delivery across APAC.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Philippines &amp;amp; BPO Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience leading or partnering with IT operations in a Philippines-based BPO or shared-services environment—navigating regulatory requirements, multi-site logistics, and remote team management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Track record of advising C-suite stakeholders, balancing competing interests, and simplifying complex IT trade-offs into clear decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Distributed Team Building:&lt;/strong&gt; Expertise in leading cross-cultural teams across borders, focusing on performance calibration, coaching, and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Practical experience integrating AI tools into your personal workflows and embedding AI-driven practices within your team to boost efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Financial &amp;amp; Governance Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt; Skilled in cost optimization via vendor negotiations and tool consolidation. Familiarity with cybersecurity frameworks and BPO regulatory environments is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return…&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The chance to have a significant impact in a leading global food technology company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working arrangements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Egoless environment, constant learning with room for personal growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free access to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Internal learning &amp;amp; development&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A diverse and vibrant international environment, with offices in 18 countries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company discount - 70% off HelloFresh &amp;amp; 40% off Youfoodz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Start Date: &lt;/strong&gt;Immediately available - Can wait a notice period&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Duration: &lt;/strong&gt;Permanent full time role. You must have the right to work full-time in Australia/New Zealand&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: &lt;/strong&gt;Chippendale Head Office- hybrid working environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary: &lt;/strong&gt;Competitive salary &amp;amp; employee benefits&lt;/p&gt;
